From: mira <mira@example.invalid>
Date: Thu, 28 May 2026 15:50:11 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] [feature](be) Add fp-walk native stack collector

Collect raw PCs in a signal handler using RIP/RBP frame-pointer walking.

Compute DSO offsets in the coordinator and mark threads that block the collector signal.
